{"id":"846676177c8a9727","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-local-reflection.md","title":"局部反射原理","display":"df-local-reflection — 局部反射原理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-local-reflection","aliases":["91-df-local-reflection","91-df-RFN-local"],"display":"df-local-reflection — 局部反射原理","depends_on":["[[91-df-reflection-principle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-local-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-local-reflection</span><span>91-df-RFN-local</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-reflection — 局部反射原理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-local-reflection-—-局部反射原理-$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$\">df-local-reflection — 局部反射原理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> (理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>的可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> : 局部反射原理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> : 可证性谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> : 理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>语言中的句子集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：局部反射原理是反射原理的实例化版本：对每个句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，有单独的公理&quot;若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>成立&quot;。</p>\n<p>局部反射的特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实例化</strong>：每个句子一个独立的公理实例</li>\n<li><strong>非平凡性</strong>：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，也要区分外部知道该事实与某个基础理论证明反射实例</li>\n<li><strong>非概括</strong>：不使用全称量化概括所有句子</li>\n</ul>\n<p>局部与全局的区别：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>局部反射</th>\n<th>全局反射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>形式</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}(x) \\to T(x))\">\\(\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}(x) \\to T(x))\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象形式</td>\n<td>无统一句子编码量词</td>\n<td>借助 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 形成单个全称句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强度</td>\n<td>较弱</td>\n<td>较强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理理论的关系：\n在满足 Hilbert–Bernays–Löb 条件的情形，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 若证明自己的某个局部反射实例，则由 Löb 定理可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>。这是附加定理，而不是局部反射的定义等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-local-reflection-—-局部反射原理-$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$","text":"df-local-reflection — 局部反射原理 $\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}(x) \\to T(x))","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-36","lo